                  <photoshop:LayerText>REFUND POLICY: MERCHANDISE MAY BE RETURNED OR EXCHANGED WITHIN 90 DAYS WITH AN ORIGINAL RECEIPT. AFTER 90 DAYS. OR WITHOUT A RECEIPT MERCHANDISE MAY BE EXCHANGED, OR RETURNED FOR A COURTESY RETURN CARD ONLY. WE REGRET THAT REFUNDS CAN NOT BE GIVEN WITHOUT A RECEIPT. VALID ID REQUIRED FOR  RETURNS/EXCHANGES. MERCHANDISE MUST BE NEW AND UNUSED WITH ANY TAGS ATTACHED AND FOOTWEAR IN ORIGINAL BOXES.  WE THANK YOU FOR SHOPPING WITH ADIDAS. SHOP ONLINE AT WWW.ADIDAS.COM  Follow us on Twitter: @adidasnyc Instagram: @adidasnyc </photoshop:LayerText>
